+## Completed (Request 18)
+- Added lateFee(invoice, asOf) to src/reports.js
+  - Calculates late fees at 0.04% per day for overdue invoices
+  - Only applies to invoices with status 'issued', 'partially_paid', or 'paid'
+  - Calculates on remaining balance due (after partial payments)
+  - Returns 0 if:
+    - asOf date is invalid
+    - Invoice has no dueDate
+    - Invoice is not overdue (dueDate >= asOf)
+    - Invoice is draft or paid in full
+  - Formula: lateFee = due × 0.04 / 100 × daysOverdue
+  - Result is always integer cents (rounded with roundCents)
+- Added 15 comprehensive tests covering:
+  - Non-overdue invoices (return 0)
+  - Due date boundary (exact date returns 0)
+  - Draft invoices (return 0 despite dueDate)
+  - Invalid dates (return 0)
+  - Single day and multiple day overdue
+  - 0.04% rate calculation accuracy
+  - Partial payments (fee on remaining balance)
+  - Fully paid invoices (return 0)
+  - Large amounts and many days
+  - Discounted invoices
+  - Integer cent values
+  - Consistency with balanceDue and invoiceTotals
+  - House rules compliance (no throw, integer cents)
+- All 249 tests pass (234 existing + 15 new)
+
 ## Next Steps
 - Ready for additional invoice features (persistence, invoice lifecycle, etc.)
